      "desc": "The DNS answer in an HTTP response",
      "detail": "The resolver answers 200 with a body of type application/dns-message: the same DNS answer as the plain lookup, A 203.0.113.10. Because it arrives through TLS from dns.google, nobody on the way could have changed it.",
